<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1929</h1><p class="ref-lede">1929 in world history: 38 events, 21 births, 18 deaths, 3 states founded and 4 that came to an end. 725 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
